{"episodes":{"162978":"Scattered showers and thunderstorms impacted the desert to the coast on September 24. Locally heavy rainfall occurred across San Diego County with rainfall of 0.5 to 1 inch occurring, locally higher 1 to 2 inches near Palomar Mountain. A rare Severe Thunderstorm Warning was issued for downtown San Diego. Widespread hail and strong winds were reported.","163145":"A cutoff low near the southern California coast helped fuel isolated thunderstorms over southern San Bernardino County. One storm produced severe weather.","163379":"Heavy rain brought flooding to the Cache River at Patterson in late September.","163734":"A slow moving cold front brought slow moving thunderstorms with heavy rain through the area on the evening of September 23rd into early morning on the 24th. Rainfall amounts generally ranged from 1-3 inches with some locally higher amounts. Most of the rainfall fell in a 1-2 hour period."},"events":[{"begin":"2021-09-24T03:55Z","county":"Fairfield","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2021-09-24T04:25Z","endLat":41.1864,"endLon":-73.4636,"episode":163734,"id":988632,"injuries":0,"lat":41.1839,"location":"1.12 S North Wilton","lon":-73.4705,"narrative":"Flash flooding due to heavy rain resulted in the closure of Wild Duck Road in Wilton, CT.","source":"Public","state":"CT","type":"Flash Flood","wfo":"OKX"},{"begin":"2021-09-24T04:25Z","county":"Fairfield","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2021-09-24T04:55Z","endLat":41.2825,"endLon":-73.2144,"episode":163734,"id":988633,"injuries":0,"lat":41.2782,"location":"1.98 N Long Hill","lon":-73.2271,"narrative":"Whitney Avenue was reported closed to due flash flooding from heavy rain in Trumbull, CT.","source":"Public","state":"CT","type":"Flash Flood","wfo":"OKX"},{"begin":"2021-09-24T14:15Z","county":"Woodruff","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2021-09-25T18:52Z","endLat":35.2559,"endLon":-91.2578,"episo